ca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN/Toom/Ops.lean#L218-L218"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN/Toom/Ops.html#MPN.Toom.ToomOps.mid\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">Toom</span>.<span class=\"name\">ToomOps</span>.<span class=\"name\">mid</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">A</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">L</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#outParam\">outParam</a> <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></span>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">inst✝</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/LimbArray.html#MPN.LimbArray\">LimbArray</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">L</span></span>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/Toom/Ops.html#MPN.Toom.ToomOps\">ToomOps</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">L</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">A</span> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a> → <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">A</span> → <span class=\"fn\">A</span></span></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The middle term of Karatsuba's method: with `Z₀` in the `2 k` limbs of `d` from `o` on and `Z₂`\nin the `n - 2 k` limbs above, and `t = Z₀ + Z₁ + Z₂` in the `2 k + 2` limbs of `t`, writes\n`Z₀ + 2^(w k) Z₁ + 2^(2 w k) Z₂` into the `n` limbs from `o`: `mid d o k n t`.","doc